  "statement": "Evaluate $\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\pi/2} x\\\\sin x\\\\,dx$ using integration by parts.",
  "solution": "Let $u=x$, $dv=\\\\sin x\\\\,dx$; then $du=dx$, $v=-\\\\cos x$. $\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\pi/2}x\\\\sin x\\\\,dx=[-x\\\\cos x]_{0}^{\\\\pi/2}+\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\pi/2}\\\\cos x\\\\,dx=0+[\\\\sin x]_{0}^{\\\\pi/2}=1$.",
